  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2026.2.01.03:\n      - Added gRPC support with secure and unsecure clients/services\n      - Added WebSocket support with auto-reconnect capability\n      - Added SignalR support with auto-reconnect capability\n      - Added SSE (Server-Sent Events) support with auto-reconnect capability\n      - Added consolidated authentication infrastructure (Bearer, Basic, API Key, Custom)\n      - Added protocol-specific configuration options (GrpcDeadlineSeconds, WebSocketAutoReconnect, etc.)\n      - Added fluent builder methods for new protocol options\n\n      v2025.4.04.01:\n      - Added generic deserialization methods to REST APIs (GetAsync<T>, PostAsync<TReq,TRes>, etc.)\n      - Added configurable error reporting via ApiClientOptions.EnableErrorReporting\n      - Refactored ServiceCollectionExtensions to eliminate code duplication\n      - Changed service lifetimes from Scoped to Transient for better compatibility\n      - Removed empty IDisposable implementations\n      - Fire-and-forget error reporting for non-blocking SQS messages\n      - Comprehensive README.md and XML documentation with examples\n      - 38 new unit tests for generic methods and configuration",
